{"schema_version":1,"game_version":"Cygnus v4.5.2 (9776)","extracted_at":"2026-10-12","namespace":"gameplay","source":"projects_3","count":36,"entries":[{"key":"DERELICT_SHIP_PROJECT","zh":"废弃舰船","en":"Derelict Ship","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":8,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":6,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131174"},{"key":"DERELICT_SHIP_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一条舰船漂浮在太空中，没有信号交互。更仔细的检查也许能弄清她的船员遭遇了些什么。","en":"A ship adrift in space, no signals going in or coming out. Inspecting it more closely might shed some light on what has happened to the crew.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":9,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":7,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131175"},{"key":"ODD_STAR_PROJECT","zh":"炉中之火","en":"Fire of the Furnace","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":10,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":8,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131176"},{"key":"ODD_STAR_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"这颗星似乎能聚变产生铍，但这理应是不可能的。","en":"The star is appearing to be able to fuse beryllium, which shouldn't be possible.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":11,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":9,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131177"},{"key":"IMPROBABLE_TEAPOT_PROJECT","zh":"难以置信的瓷器","en":"Improbable Ceramics","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":12,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":10,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131178"},{"key":"IMPROBABLE_TEAPOT_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一个陶瓷茶壶围绕着恒星公转……这实在令人难以置信。搞清楚它是怎么形成的需要耗费很多时间。谁知道我们能否找到这个问题的答案，或者说甚至这个问题根本就没有答案？","en":"A ceramic pot is orbiting a sun... this is beyond improbable. Figuring out what it does there will take quite some time. Who knows what the answer will be, or if there even is one?","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":13,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":11,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131179"},{"key":"AI_ADMIRAL_PROJECT","zh":"沙漠中的战士","en":"Warrior from Sand","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":14,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":12,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131180"},{"key":"AI_ADMIRAL_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一支在沙漠星球上坠毁的古老舰队被发现了，她们的舰载AI仍然活跃。如果我们不去压制她，情况会急转直下。","en":"An ancient fleet has been found crashed on a desert planet, with a still-active shipboard AI. If we do not move to subdue it, things might take a turn for the worse.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":15,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":13,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131181"},{"key":"MINING_GEAR_PROJECT","zh":"钻头横行","en":"Drill Rampage","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":16,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":14,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131182"},{"key":"MINING_GEAR_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一个古老的挖掘机正在向巨大的小行星深处挖掘。如果我们能够在碎石压坏它之前停下它，我们也许可以学到一些建设方面有用的东西。","en":"An ancient excavator is digging deep into a giant asteroid. If we can stop it before it gets crushed by debris we might be able to learn something worthwhile about the construction.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":17,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":15,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131183"},{"key":"ABANDONED_ARRAY_PROJECT","zh":"遗弃的传感阵列","en":"Abandoned Sensor Array","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":18,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":16,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131184"},{"key":"ABANDONED_ARRAY_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一座被遗弃的传感器阵列似乎处于工作状态。如果我们能修复它并弄清楚它是如何工作的，我们也许能获得更多周边星系的详细信息。","en":"An abandoned sensor dish seems to be in working condition. If we perform some repairs and figure out how it functions we might be able to gain more insight into neighboring systems.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":19,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":17,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131185"},{"key":"ALIEN_RACER_PROJECT","zh":"漂泊","en":"Adrift","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":20,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":18,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131186"},{"key":"ALIEN_RACER_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一艘外星飞船在小行星带中漂泊。它并没有回应呼叫。我们应该调查到底发生了什么。","en":"An alien ship is drifting inside an asteroid belt. It will not respond to hails. We should investigate and see what is going on.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":21,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":19,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131187"},{"key":"PSIONIC_HORSES_PROJECT","zh":"平原之主","en":"The Rulers of the Plains","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":22,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":20,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131188"},{"key":"PSIONIC_HORSES_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一个宏伟的哺乳动物种群漫步在水草丰茂的旷野。他们似乎对我们的靠近有点不安。近距离的研究能带给我们更多的信息。","en":"A majestic race of mammals roam fields of water grass. They seem skittish and have insight into our approaches. Studying them up close could give us more information.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":23,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":21,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131189"},{"key":"ROBOT_CLEANERS_PROJECT","zh":"遗留的机械","en":"The Machines Left Behind","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":24,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":22,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131190"},{"key":"ROBOT_CLEANERS_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"在一颗遥远的星球上发现一座了塞满机器人的工厂。如果我们重新激活他们，可能会揭示他们家园的秘密。","en":"A facility filled with robots has been found on a distant planet. If we reactivate them, they might reveal the secrets of their home.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":25,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":23,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131191"},{"key":"ALIEN_MONSTER_ON_SHIP","zh":"外星怪兽登舰","en":"Alien Beast Onboard","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":26,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":24,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131192"},{"key":"ALIEN_MONSTER_ON_SHIP_DESC","zh":"[Root.Owner.GetMonsterOnShipDesc]","en":"[Root.Owner.GetMonsterOnShipDesc]","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":27,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":25,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131193"},{"key":"TREE_OF_LIFE","zh":"大树","en":"The Tree","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":28,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":26,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131194"},{"key":"TREE_OF_LIFE_DESC","zh":"一棵树孤零零地在太空的虚无中漂流，它的汁液吸引了太空中的各种凶猛生物。我们应该调查它的作用。","en":"A tree drifts defiantly through the emptiness of space. Its sap seems to attract monstrous spaceborne organics. We should investigate to figure out its purpose.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":29,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":27,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131195"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_POLITICS","zh":"翻译定居者的文本","en":"Translating Settlers' Texts","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":30,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":28,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131196"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_POLITICS_DESC","zh":"我们发现了一摞文件，这似乎对一个已经消亡的社群很重要。翻译它们定能为我们提供更深入了解其历史与文化的机会。","en":"We have uncovered a stash of documents that seem to have been important to the now dead society. Translating them will surely provide us with a more in-depth look into its history and culture.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":31,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":29,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131197"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_PHILOSOPHY","zh":"翻译探险家的文本","en":"Translating Explorers' Texts","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":32,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":30,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131198"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_PHILOSOPHY_DESC","zh":"我们发现了一个外星人探险家携带的一些文本。如果我们能够翻译它们，我们也许能了解更多有关它曾经主人的信息。","en":"We've found some texts that were carried by an alien expedition. If we translate them we might uncover more information and learn about the previous owners.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":33,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":31,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131199"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_DIPLOMACY","zh":"翻译贸易者的文本","en":"Translating Traders' Texts","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":34,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":32,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131200"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_DIPLOMACY_DESC","zh":"我们在一个貌似星际贸易站的废墟中发现了一些文本。如果我们能够翻译这些文件，我们可以更多地了解那些建立它的人。","en":"We've found some texts among the ruins of a possible interstellar trading hub. If we translate these documents we could learn more about the ones who founded it.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":35,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":33,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131201"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_WAR","zh":"翻译战士的文本","en":"Translating Warrior's Texts","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":36,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":34,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131202"},{"key":"MASTERS_WRITINGS_WAR_DESC","zh":"我们在一个废弃已久的战场遗迹上发现了一群战士的遗骸，以及他们所携带的必定对他们很重要的文件。如果我们翻译这些文件，我们可以了解的更多关于这个种族以及他们所进行的战争。","en":"We found remains of a warrior people on a long abandoned battlefield, and they were carrying texts that must have been important to them. If we translate these documents we could learn more about this people and the wars they fought.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":37,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":35,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131203"},{"key":"CRYOPOD_FOUND_PROJECT","zh":"地下避难所","en":"Underground Vault","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":38,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":36,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131204"},{"key":"CRYOPOD_FOUND_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"我们在山体底下找到了一个可能包含宝贵信息或者装置的建筑物。它的周围有危险的野生动物，为了得到它我们需要制服这些野兽。","en":"We found a structure beneath a mountain which could contain valuable information or gear. It is surrounded by dangerous wildlife and we need to subdue these beasts in order to get to it.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":39,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":37,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131205"},{"key":"CRYOPOD_OPENING_PROJECT","zh":"撬开它","en":"Cracking it Open","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":40,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":38,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131206"},{"key":"CRYOPOD_OPENING_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"我们发现的避难所中存放着一个容器。如果我们想知道里面有什么，我们需要找到撬开它的最佳方法。","en":"The underground vault we found held only a container of sorts. We need to figure out how to best pry it open if we want to find out what is inside.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":41,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":39,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131207"},{"key":"ANCIENT_OCEAN_SHIP","zh":"被淹没的巡洋舰","en":"Submerged Cruiser","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":42,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":40,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131208"},{"key":"ANCIENT_OCEAN_SHIP_DESC","zh":"一艘外星人的巡洋舰躺在[Root.GetName]的海底。打捞她也许能得到宝贵的技术或资源。","en":"An alien battlecruiser lies beneath the waves of [Root.GetName]. Salvaging it could yield valuable technology or resources.","source":"projects_3","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_3_l_english.yml","el":43,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_3_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":41,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131209"}]}